{"4073930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Go-Kart Racing 3", "steam_appid": 4073930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your karting skills in a Career Mode where you'll manage your racing career through several different types of racing events.  Battle to win races,  handle media interviews,  and customize your go-kart paint livery to your desired style as you try to become the best go kart driver in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES &amp; MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Trials </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go-Kart Livery Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New HD Go-Kart Race Tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirt Track Racing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAREER MODE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through an in-depth Career Mode as your develop your skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with media reporters to handle your public reputation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up through the ranks as you earn achievements and improve your standing on the leaderboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QUICK RACES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the length of your own races on several different racetracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in quick races to practice and improve your speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETITIVE RACING</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense multi-groove racing that features real-time pathfinding and maneuverability from every driver.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drivers can react to your driving style on the fly and make real-time decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying levels of difficulty from each driver as they each have their own unique traits and driving skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HIGH DEFINITION GRAPHICS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major improvements and upgrades to the high-definition rendering capabilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom &amp; Animated Driver IK that Improves Every Animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DirectX 12 Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your karting skills in a Career Mode where you'll manage your racing career through several different types of racing events.  Battle to win races,  handle media interviews,  and customize your go-kart paint livery to your desired style as you try to become the best go kart driver in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES &amp; MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Trials </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go-Kart Livery Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New HD Go-Kart Race Tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirt Track Racing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAREER MODE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through an in-depth Career Mode as your develop your skills. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with media reporters to handle your public reputation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\